# ---- generic AD objects + schema (dsa.msc object editor) ------------------
# Reads go straight to the DC's sam.ldb via ldbsearch (no credentials — we are
# root inside the container); writes go to the PDC emulator via ldbmodify /
# ldbrename / ldbdel. The forest is single-domain, so the Configuration and
# Schema naming contexts are derived, not queried.

